        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Asa, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, okobua Abaetiopia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiya agakwa, akarara ase chisokoro chiaye chiaraarete, agatindekwa ase Omochie o Daudi, na Asa, omwana oye omomura, akaba okogamba ase ribaga riaye. Ase amatuko aye ense eria nigo yabeete n’obotoereru ase engaki y’emiaka ikomi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa agakora ayare amaya naende amaronge ase amaiso ’Omonene, Nyasae oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarusia ebisasimero ebigeni na agasaria aase aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa, agatagora chisiiro, akanacha emete y’Asera, enyasae eria enkungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agachiika Abayuda barigie Omonene, Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiabo, naende akabachika barende amachiiko na emeroberio ende echiikire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarusia korwa ase emechie yonsi y’Abayuda aase aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa, na ebisasimero bi’ogosamba ubani. Na oborwoti boria bokaba bore n’obotoereru inse yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaagacha emechie yagiteire chindwaki agwo ase ense ya Yuda, ekiagera ense eria nigo yarenge n’obotoereru; tabwate chiseegi ase amatuko aria, ekiagera Omonene amoete omorembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agateebia Abayuda, “Inchuo toagache emechie eye toyeetananie chindwaki amo nemerobiri, na ebiita bire nemekorogoto. Ense eye nigo egendererete koba eyaito, ekiagera twarigirie Omonene, Nyasae oito; intwe twamorigirie, na ere otoeire omorembe ase chinsemo chiaito chionsi.” Ase ayio bakaagacha na bagasesenigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa nigo abwate abasikari chilifu amagana atato (300,000) korwa ase Abayuda, mbabwate ching’aya na amatimo, na abarwani bande b’esegi chilifu amagana abere na emerongo etano na etato (280,000) korwa ase Ababenjamini mbabwate chinguba, bamanyete koruta emegwe. Abanto aba bonsi nigo barenge abe chinguru, chituoni ase okorwana esegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sera Omoetiopia amo nabarwani baye b’esegi emilioni eyemo (1,000,000) abarenge ne chigari amagana atato bagacha kobarwania esegi, bagaika Maresa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa akagenda koumerana nere ase okorwana esegi. Bagatenenera agwo ase rikura ria Sefata ang’e na Maresa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa akarera ase Omonene, Nyasae oye, agateeba, “Aye Omonene, onde tari onga buna aye ase ogokonya abatari ne chinguru na abare ne chinguru. Ase ayio, aye Omonene, Nyasae oito, otokonye, ekiagera naye tosemeretie, na ase erieta riao twachire korwana nomoganda oyo omonene. Aye Omonene, aye naye Nyasae oito, omonto onde tari orakobue.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Omonene akabua Abaetiopia ase obosio bwa Asa, na ase obosio bw’Abayuda; na Abaetiopia bagatama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa amo nabaanto barenge nere bakabwatia Abaetiopia goika Gerari, na Abaetiopia bagaitwa, nonya noyomo tatigetwe ore moyo; ekiagera Omonene na abarwani baye b’esegi nigo baababuete kegima. Abayuda bagasakora ebinto ebinge bakabiira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabua na gosaria emechie yonsi yaetanaine Gerari, ekiagera Omonene abegete obwoba ase abanto b’emechie eria. Bagasakora ebinto korwa ase emechie eria yonsi, ekiagera ebinto ebinge bi’ogosakorwa mbiarengeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagatagora na gosaria chiema chi’abaanto baria babwate chitugo, bakaira ching’ondi ne chimbori chinyinge ne chingamia. Erio bakairana, bakagenda Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
